/ActualText (Backend Developer with 3+ years of experience in .NET/C# and SQL Server, working across ERP, banking, and real-time communication platforms. I specialize in refactoring production systems and building integration tests that keep them stable. I also use Claude Code and Cursor daily to speed up development, and have built custom agents for recurring team tasks. Passionate about mentoring \024 I've onboarded new developers and run technical interviews.)
